{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/vue/11_props/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<h2 id=\"props\" style=\"position:relative;\">props<a href=\"#props\" aria-label=\"props permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">{{ 데이터바인딩 }}</code> 은 밑에 script 에 데이터가 있어야 가능하다.</p>\n<p>App.vue 에 있는 데이터들을 ModalDetail.vue 컴포넌트에서 사용하려면 props를 사용해야 한다.<br>\n보통 App.vue에 모든 데이터를 몰아놓고 props를 이용해 필요한 곳에 가져다 쓴다.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>부모 컴포넌트 : App.vue</li>\n<li>자식 컴포넌트 : ModalDetail.vue</li>\n</ul>\n<p>자식 컴포넌트는 부모가 가지고 있는 데이터를 가져다 쓰고싶을 경우 props 문법으로 전송을 해야 한다.<br>\n<strong>자식 컴포넌트에 있는 데이터를 부모 컴포넌트에서 가져다 쓰려면 props 문법으로 불가능하다.</strong><br>\n데이터를 만들때는 최상위 컴포넌트에 만드는게 좋다.</p>\n<h2 id=\"props-문법-step\" style=\"position:relative;\">props 문법 step<a href=\"#props-%EB%AC%B8%EB%B2%95-step\" aria-label=\"props 문법 step permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li>데이터 전송</li>\n<li>등록</li>\n<li>사용</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"1-데이터-전송\" style=\"position:relative;\">1. 데이터 전송<a href=\"#1-%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%84%B0-%EC%A0%84%EC%86%A1\" aria-label=\"1 데이터 전송 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>App.vue</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">&lt;!--\r\n&lt;ModalDetail v-bind:데이터이름=&quot;데이터이름&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;ModalDetail :데이터이름=&quot;데이터이름&quot; /&gt;\r\n--&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ModalDetail :원룸들=&quot;원룸들&quot; :누른거=&quot;누른거&quot; :모달창열렸니=&quot;모달창열렸니&quot; /&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;!-- props 보내는 여러가지 방법 --&gt;\r\n&lt;Discount :데이터이름=&quot;[1,2,3]&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;Discount :데이터이름=&quot;{ age:20 }&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;Discount :데이터이름=&quot;100&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;Discount 데이터이름=&quot;안녕하쇼&quot; /&gt;</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"2-등록\" style=\"position:relative;\">2. 등록<a href=\"#2-%EB%93%B1%EB%A1%9D\" aria-label=\"2 등록 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>ModalDetail.vue<br>\n이름과 데이터 형식을 등록해준다.<br>\n데이터 형식은 디버깅용이기 때문에 잘못 써도 에러가 나진 않는다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">&lt;script&gt;\r\nexport default {\r\n  name: &#39;ModalDetail&#39;,\r\n  props: {\r\n    원룸들: Object, // Number, String, Array, Boolean\r\n    누른거: Number,\r\n    모달창열렸니: Number,\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n&lt;/script&gt;</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"3-사용\" style=\"position:relative;\">3. 사용<a href=\"#3-%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9\" aria-label=\"3 사용 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">&lt;template&gt;\r\n  &lt;div class=&quot;black-bg&quot; v-if=&quot;모달창열렸니==1&quot;&gt;\r\n    &lt;div class=&quot;white-bg&quot;&gt;\r\n      &lt;img :src=&quot;원룸들[누른거].image&quot; class=&quot;room-img&quot;&gt;\r\n      &lt;h4&gt;{{ 원룸들[누른거].title }}&lt;/h4&gt;\r\n      &lt;p&gt;{{ 원룸들[누른거].content }}&lt;/p&gt;\r\n      &lt;p&gt;{{ 원룸들[누른거].price }}&lt;/p&gt;\r\n      &lt;button @click=&quot;모달창열렸니=0&quot;&gt;닫기&lt;/button&gt;\r\n    &lt;/div&gt;\r\n  &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/template&gt;</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<blockquote class=\"prompt-danger\">\n<p>에러가 발생함 : props로 전달받은 데이터는 수정할 수 없다.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"원룸-리스트-component로-나누기\" style=\"position:relative;\">원룸 리스트 component로 나누기<a href=\"#%EC%9B%90%EB%A3%B8-%EB%A6%AC%EC%8A%A4%ED%8A%B8-component%EB%A1%9C-%EB%82%98%EB%88%84%EA%B8%B0\" aria-label=\"원룸 리스트 component로 나누기 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">&lt;template&gt;\r\n&lt;!-- &lt;ProductCard v-for=&quot;(a,i) in 원룸들&quot; :key=&quot;i&quot; :a=&quot;a&quot; :i=&quot;i&quot;  /&gt; --&gt;\r\n&lt;ProductCard v-for=&quot;(a,i) in 원룸들&quot; :key=&quot;i&quot; :원룸=&quot;원룸들[i]&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;/template&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;script&gt;\r\nimport ProductCard from &#39;./components/ProductCard.vue&#39;;\r\n\r\n...\r\n\r\ncomponents: {\r\n  ProductCard : ProductCard,\r\n}\r\n&lt;/script&gt;</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>ProductCard.vue</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">&lt;template&gt;\r\n  &lt;div&gt;\r\n    &lt;img :src=&quot;원룸.image&quot; class=&quot;room-img&quot;&gt;\r\n    &lt;h4 @click=&quot;모달창열렸니=1; 누른거=i;&quot;&gt;{{ 원룸.title }}&lt;/h4&gt;\r\n    &lt;p&gt;{{ 원룸.content }}&lt;/p&gt;\r\n    &lt;p&gt;{{ 원룸.price }}원&lt;/p&gt;\r\n  &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/template&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;script&gt;\r\nexport default {\r\n  name: &#39;ProductCard&#39;,\r\n  props: {\r\n    // 원룸들: Object,\r\n    // a: Object,\r\n    // i: Number,\r\n    원룸: Object,\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n&lt;/script&gt;</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>","tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#props\">props</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#props-%EB%AC%B8%EB%B2%95-step\">props 문법 step</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#1-%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%84%B0-%EC%A0%84%EC%86%A1\">1. 데이터 전송</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#2-%EB%93%B1%EB%A1%9D\">2. 등록</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#3-%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9\">3. 사용</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#%EC%9B%90%EB%A3%B8-%EB%A6%AC%EC%8A%A4%ED%8A%B8-component%EB%A1%9C-%EB%82%98%EB%88%84%EA%B8%B0\">원룸 리스트 component로 나누기</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>","fields":{"gitLastModified":"Oct 2, 2026"},"frontmatter":{"title":"11. props (v-bind)","summary":"props {{ 데이터바인딩 }} 은 밑에 script 에 데이터가 있어야 가능하다. App.vue 에 있는 데이터들을 ModalDetail.vue 컴포넌트에서 사용하려면 props를 사용해야 한다. 보통 App.vue에 모든 데이터를 몰아놓고 props를 이용해 필요한 곳에 가져다 쓴다.","date":"Jun 15, 2023","categories":["VUE"],"tags":[],"author":["aluvy"],"thumbnail":null}}}]}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/posts/vue/11_props/","prev":{"slug":"/posts/vue/10_component/","title":"10. component"},"next":{"slug":"/posts/vue/12_custom_event/","title":"12. custom event (부모 데이터 변경하기) $emit()"}}},"staticQueryHashes":["1397594759","2043619371"],"slicesMap":{}}